'''Red Icecrusher''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to players who finished in the Top 100 on the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]] Gifts-Given Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Red Icecrusher has the same appearance as the final stage of [[Icecrusher]], but replacing the bright blue color with a dark red coloring.

== Trivia ==
*In order to obtain this item, participants collected as many [[Snow Tokens]] in order to purchase gifts to give to other players. The total amount of gifts given would determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Icecrusher]], [[Silver Icecrusher]], and [[Gold Icecrusher]].
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

